<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n69795" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναύβιον</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cubic measure</i> in Egypt, with
			side = two royal cubits (in Roman times, three cubits),
			used with application to earth as a unit of labour, in pl., <i><span class="en">
				<u>PLille</u>
				1r
			</span></i>.<i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>, Wilcken <i><span class="en">
				<u>Chr.</u>
				385.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PPetr.</u>
				3pp.80,290
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ostr.Bodl.</u>
				i 244
			</span></i> (all <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Arch.Pap.</u>
				6.132
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A. D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				669.11
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>:—written <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναούια</span></b>  ib. <i><span class="en">
				1053
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(vi/vii A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in sg., tax paid by landholders in lieu of digging so
			many <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναύβια</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PTeb.</u>
				5.15
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ν. κατοίκων,
				ἐναφεσίων</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				662
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PTeb.</u>
				352
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> perh. another tax, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ostr.</u>
				1396
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A. D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ostr.Bodl.</u>
				iii 84
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A. D.)</span>.</div>
